        "Description": "Our vision of feminist solidarity across the Global South is inspired by a centuries-long history of womxn fighting slavery, colonialism, imperialism, white supremacy, racism, anti-blackness and cis-heteropatriarchy.\n\nThe ambition of the South Feminist Futures is for collective South-South feminist collaboration, networking, educating, learning, theorising, analysing, informing and solidarity. It is focussed equally on strengthening South feminist movements with a view to better equipping ourselves to enact transformative and radical changes at global, regional and local levels.\n\nOur programme work is organised around five pillars\n1. confronting hegemonies\n2. reclaiming South-South internationalism\n3. building a new knowledge base for South feminist activism\n4. strategies for change and resistance\n5. reimagining development",
